+## Full-family multiplicity correction
+
+The family contains every row of the published M7.4 contrast matrix (120
+contrasts) or M7.5 matrix (560 contrasts). Ten thousand stratified case-block
+bootstrap resamples were shared across contrasts. A max-z critical value was
